<title>USA: Priest Rapids project, Wash. ylds 6.03 pct in 2031.</title>
<headline>Priest Rapids project, Wash. ylds 6.03 pct in 2031.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
